// E1103: a bad key in one entry and a bad value in another are two reports, each at its line, and the good entry
// is not reported; one does not hide the other (§15.2, §15.3 `bind` row, §18.1 "互いに独立に全て報告し"; S-827).

pub fn f() -> I32 { 1 }
